            "review_text": "C. K\nDelft4 contributions\n0\nHigh quality food in a beautiful ambiance\nSep 2017 • Friends\nBest of Paula’s Wines is the dedication of the owner, Paula, and her staff. There are over 150 wines that combine with the selection of dishes. As we heard, the dishes are selected by one of the best chefs in Hanoi with international experience. If you’d like to visit Hanoi and want to eat a high quality Western dish, you surely have to eat here.\nWritten January 16, 2018",
